eta)^2\\right) \\right] \\\\\n\u0026\u003d -\\frac{n}{2} \\log(2\\pi) - \\frac{1}{2} \\sum_{i\u003d1}^{n} (x_i - \\theta)^2\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n$l(\\theta)$를 최대로 만들기 위해 $\\theta$에 대해 미분하고 그 값을 0으로 두겠습니다.\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\frac{d}{d\\theta} l(\\theta) \u0026\u003d \\frac{d}{d\\theta} \\left[ -\\frac{n}{2} \\log(2\\pi) - \\frac{1}{2} \\sum_{i\u003d1}^{n} (x_i - \\theta)^2 \\right] \\\\\n\u0026\u003d -\\frac{1}{2} \\sum_{i\u003d1}^{n} 2(x_i - \\theta)(-1) \\\\\n\u0026\u003d \\sum_{i\u003d1}^{n} (x_i - \\theta)\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n이 식을 0으로 놓고 $\\theta$에 대해 풀면,\n$$\n\\sum_{i\u003d1}^{n} (x_i - \\theta) \u003d 0 \\\\\n\\sum_{i\u003d1}^{n} x_i - \\sum_{i\u003d1}^{n} \\theta \u003d 0 \\\\\n\\sum_{i\u003d1}^{n} x_i - n\\theta \u003d 0 \\\\\n\\theta \u003d \\frac{\\sum_{i\u003d1}^{n} x_i}{n} \u003d \\bar{x}\n$$\n이계도함수를 통해 이것이 최댓값인지 확인합니다.\n$$ \\frac{d^2}{d\\theta^2} l(\\theta) \u003d \\frac{d}{d\\theta} \\left[ \\sum_{i\u003d1}^{n} (x_i - \\theta) \\right] \u003d -n $$\n이계도함수 값이 $-n \u003c 0$ 이므로, 위에서 구한 값은 $l(\\theta)$를 최대로 만듭니다.\n따라서 $\\theta$의 MLE는 $\\hat{\\theta} \u003d \\bar{X}$ 입니다.\n\n---\n\n#### **(c) $\\hat{\\theta}$의 평균제곱오차를 구하시오.**\n\n평균제곱오차(Mean Squared Error, MSE)의 정의는 다음과 같습니다.\n$$ \\text{MSE}(\\hat{\\theta}) \u003d E[(\\hat{\\theta} - \\theta)^2] \u003d \\text{Var}(\\hat{\\theta}) + [\\text{Bias}(\\hat{\\theta})]^2 $$\n여기서 $\\text{Bias}(\\hat{\\theta}) \u003d E[\\hat{\\theta}] - \\theta$ 입니다.\n\n1.  **편의(Bias) 계산:**\n    $$\n    E[\\hat{\\theta}] \u003d E[\\bar{X}] \u003d E\\left[\\frac{1}{n} \\sum_{i\u003d1}^{n} X_i\\right] \u003d \\frac{1}{n} \\sum_{i\u003d1}^{n} E[X_i]\n    $$\n    문제에서 $E[X_i] \u003d \\theta$ 이므로,\n    $$\n    E[\\hat{\\theta}] \u003d \\frac{1}{n} \\sum_{i\u003d1}^{n} \\theta \u003d \\frac{1}{n} (n\\theta) \u003d \\theta\n    $$\n    따라서 $\\text{Bias}(\\hat{\\theta}) \u003d E[\\hat{\\theta}] - \\theta \u003d \\theta - \\theta \u003d 0$ 입니다. $\\hat{\\theta}$은 불편추정량(unbiased estimator)입니다.\n\n2.  **분산(Variance) 계산:**\n    $$\n    \\t